        "original_id": "871c2605-8ed4-5552-a9f9-4357b53689de",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akili Smith, Tim Couch, Donovan McNabb\n- Organizations: Cincinnati Bengals, Cleveland Browns, Philadelphia Eagles, University of Kentucky, Kentucky Wildcats, Penn State Nittany Lions\n- Events: 1999 NFL Draft, 1999 Outback Bowl\n- Roles: Quarterbacks\n\nFacts:\n- The 1999 Outback Bowl featured the Kentucky Wildcats and the Penn State Nittany Lions.\n- Tim Couch played college football for the University of Kentucky and earned All-America honors.\n- Tim Couch was the first overall pick in the 1999 NFL Draft.\n- Akili Smith was drafted by the Cincinnati Bengals with the third overall pick in the first round of the 1999 NFL Draft.\n- Akili Smith was the third quarterback selected in the first three picks of the 1999 NFL Draft, behind Tim Couch of the Cleveland Browns and Donovan McNabb of the Philadelphia Eagles.",
